From c5fc2ac4fc9298bb3c1bcf590e6b64de594f00fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: deepagent-ai <deepagent-ai@deepagent.ltd>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 11:14:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Enable native MTP3 for compact SM120 HiSparse DCP8

Capture the drafter slot mapping before each real graph replay. Mirror the draft group from its own source rows before acknowledging page transfers.

Admit the fixed native MTP3 combination only on the qualified host-backed GLM Flash NVFP4 geometry. Retain the existing MTP0 layouts and fail closed for other speculative configurations.
